# Build context hygiene. The image ships source; runtime state arrives through
# the bind mount at run time, so none of it belongs in a layer.
#
# NOTE ON PATTERNS: Docker matches each pattern against the file's FULL path
# relative to the context root, so a bare `*.log` or `__pycache__/` only ever
# matches at the top level. Nested paths need an explicit `**/` prefix. Before
# that was fixed this file shipped 237 nested .pyc files and a nested
# src/.panel_send_events.log into the image, while appearing to exclude them.
.git
.venv
venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.claude/

# Secrets and personal data never enter the image -- they arrive through the
# bind mount at run time, exactly like .env.
**/.env
**/.env.*
vpn/
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Real resume profiles: named people, their history, their contact details.
# .gitignore treats these as private (resumes_cache/), so an image layer -- which
# is far easier to hand around than a repo -- must too. The bind mount supplies
# them at run time, and a fresh clone does not have them either, so this makes
# the image behave like a fresh checkout rather than like this laptop.
src/services/resumes/resumes_cache/

# A nested git checkout with its own history, re-synced by run.py on every
# start. Copying it in just ships a stale snapshot.
data/ats_companies/

# Runtime state and logs
.bot.lock
.bot.pid
.last_start.txt
.bot_state*.json
.reddit_seen_*.json
.message_listing_*.json
dedup_listings/
logs/
**/*.log
**/*.log.[0-9]
.resume_cache/
.resume_lab/
.ats_validation/
.e2e_output/
**/.tmp_*
chrome_profile/
chrome_profile_runtime/

# Big, rebuildable, or host-specific. Every one of these is served by the bind
# mount at run time, so shipping it in a layer only slows the build:
#   chrome_profile/     4.7 GB of browser state
#   data/jba/jobs/      504 MB of job archives
#   data/geo.db         76 MB, gitignored and regenerated by build_geo_db.py
#   data/geonames_raw/  39 MB, read only by build_geo_db.py
data/jba/jobs/
# NOT covered by data/jba/jobs/ -- this one sits a level up, at data/jba/jobs.db
data/jba/jobs.db
data/geo.db
data/geonames_raw/
models/
**/node_modules/
# Gitignored: a local pin, not source, and the image installs requirements.txt.
requirements-lock.txt
autofill_extension/
**/*.zip
